abstract: "DMBD — PyTorch implementation of dynamic Markov blanket detection for time-series data, finding how parent/child/spouse neighborhoods and sensory, active, and internal state partitions shift over time via conditional independence tests, temporal windowing, and information-flow analysis. Follows Beck & Ramstead (2025)."
